'''Chun-Li Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]] and can be unlocked as a [[Daily Bonus|Stamp Reward]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 509
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Chun-Li Cat
|name2 = Chun-Li Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Chun-Li Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Chun-Li Cat can be useful for very early-game [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] stages such as [[Return of Terror]] or [[Love, Metal Hippoe (Hard)|Love, Metal Hippoe]]. However, once you get past [[Empire of Cats]], this Cat sees limited use, and is primarily used for getting [[User Rank]] levels. However, she can see use in [[Aguham (Cats of the Cosmos)|Aguham]] due to her specific attributes of being a Special Critter. However, this role is now a bit saturated, and she's made essentially obsolete if other Critters (namely [[Crazed Moneko (Special Cat)|Crazed Moneko]]) are owned.
Besides these few use cases, however, you're unlikely to see her outside of a cage in the [[Underground Labyrinth]].

{{Job|Classification = Critter & User Rank Dump}}

